  choices = $EXPL$["Both structures produce identical annual expense of $50,000 per year because total compensation cost is the same regardless of vesting structure","Cliff vesting recognizes $50,000 per year straight-line; graded vesting front-loads expense because each tranche has its own shorter service period","Graded vesting defers all expense to Year 3 because no compensation expense is recognized until each individual tranche fully vests","Cliff vesting front-loads expense while graded vesting spreads it evenly because cliff vesting creates greater uncertainty about employee retention"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
